  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 66 as printed (臺北 11 on p. 474; 新竹 13, 臺中 15, 臺南 13, 高雄 7, 臺東 1, 總計 and 5 earlier years on p. 475). First column holds the bracketed 州廳 name (臺北, 新竹, 臺中, 臺南, 高雄, 臺東), repeated on every row; 〃 = ditto 株式會社 as printed. The 臺車數 figures are printed offset from their labels; assigned in order (counts agree).",
   "Notation: a small figure '(1)n' printed between two 線路延長 figures is written after the figure above it ('40.8 (1)8.[?]'); (1) = 複線 per the footnote. Sub-figures in the 新竹 block: under 桃園軌道 40.8, under 臺灣軌道 24.5, under 新竹拓殖軌道 21.6 (position by proximity, ambiguous).",
   "Unreadable: row 桃園軌道株式會社, small figure '8.[?]' last digit hidden by the column rule; row 新竹拓殖軌道株式會社, small figure '9.[?]' last digit hidden by the rule. (If they were 8.9 and 9.0 the 新竹 計 sub-figure 37.3 would be the sum; not used.)",
   "Small figures near the rule read with some doubt: 臺灣軌道 '19.4', 新竹 計 '37.3', and in 總計/year rows '37.3', '39.2', '34.2', '43.6', '42.8', '43.2' (final digits close to the rule; read as printed, no arithmetic used).",
   "Checks: operator rows sum to each 州廳 計 for 線路延長 and 臺車數 (all reconcile; main figures only, sub-figures excluded); 州廳 計 sum to 總計 576.1 (computed 576.1) and 5,245 (computed 5,245) incl. 臺東 8.8 / 20."
  ],
